# Direct dependencies for building and testing BookTrans on Windows. Lock with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes --no-header packaging/requirements.in -o packaging/requirements-lock.txt
# ctranslate2 is NOT installed from PyPI for the Windows build: its PyPI wheel links Intel
# MKL/OpenMP. packaging/build_ctranslate2_cpu.ps1 builds a CPU-only wheel from source
# (numpy and pyyaml below are its runtime dependencies).
